    "post_install": "& ((Get-ChildItem (Join-Path $scoopdir 'buckets\\\\*\\\\bin\\\\hook.ps1') -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object -First 1).FullName) 'hooks/metatrader4/post_install.ps1'",
    "pre_uninstall": "& ((Get-ChildItem (Join-Path $scoopdir 'buckets\\\\*\\\\bin\\\\hook.ps1') -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object -First 1).FullName) 'hooks/metatrader4/pre_uninstall.ps1'",
    "bin": [
        [
            "terminal.exe",
            "metatrader4",
            "/portable"
        ]
    ],
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "terminal.exe",
            "MetaTrader 4",
            "/portable"
        ]
    ],
    "persist": [
        "config",
        "history",
        "logs",
        "MQL4",
        "profiles",
        "templates",
        "tester"
    ],
    "notes": [
        "从本仓库 GitHub Release 下载纯程序 7z（无账号/图表数据）；换电脑可直接 scoop install。",
        "快捷方式 / shim 强制 /portable；数据写在 persist。",
        "若本机仍有 D:\\Program\\MetaTrader\\MetaTrader 4，post_install 会可选迁入数据。",
        "多账号：& \"$env:SCOOP\\buckets\\scoop-bucket\\bin\\mt-clone.ps1\" -App metatrader4 -Name <实例名>",
        "同步程序：同上 -SyncBinaries。卸载模板不删除 persist\\metatrader4-instances。"
    ]
